=== summary ===
Per-seat best-response utility, both signed so higher is better for the
solver: seat 1 is the value it secures as player 1, seat 2 the negated
value it concedes as player 2. A Nash profile requires BOTH to be optimal,
so both paired deltas must be nonnegative — a NashConv-style sum can hide
a transfer that helps one seat and hurts the other.

